  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Changed\n- The updaterepo command-line tool now uses a lightweight custom command-line runner instead of Cocona, and gains a --self-test command to verify the installed tool works. Trimming, Native AOT-style analysers and IsAotCompatible are enabled for the libraries, and each runtime identifier is packed as self-contained ReadyToRun (Native AOT and trimming are not yet possible, as IL2026 in FunFair.BuildCheck.Runner blocks them, so PublishAot stays disabled).",
